  aciklama:
  - "Gelece\u011Fine odakland\u0131\u011F\u0131mda, seni \xFCz\xFCm salk\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131n
    alt\u0131nda, serin bir g\xF6lgelikte otururken g\xF6r\xFCyorum {{isim}}. Sen
    {{ay_-2}} ay\u0131nda bir s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131 ya\u015Fam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Ya \u015Fans yan\u0131nda olmam\u0131\u015F ya da bir \u015Fey g\xF6nl\xFCn\xFCn
    raz\u0131 gelmedi\u011Fi \u015Fekilde cereyan etmi\u015F. G\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm
    \xFCz\xFCm salk\u0131mlar\u0131, olumsuz gibi g\xF6z\xFCken bu i\u015Ften {{ay_+1}}
    ay\u0131 ve sonraki aylarda pek \xE7ok fayda sa\u011Flayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131,
    sevin\xE7 ve keyfinin buna mukabil artaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 i\u015Faret etmekte."
